WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.388
Step 1. Open the tag picker.

1.2
00:00:02.388 --> 00:00:07.199
Care saves each tag change at once, so there is no Save button.

1.3
00:00:07.199 --> 00:00:11.135
On the profile, in Patient Tags, select Edit.

2.1
00:00:11.135 --> 00:00:17.585
Step 2. Find the tag. The picker lists Selected Tags, Tag Groups and Other Tags.

2.2
00:00:17.585 --> 00:00:20.488
Select a group to see its tags.

3.1
00:00:20.488 --> 00:00:25.829
Step 3. Apply a tag. Select a tag that the patient does not have.

3.2
00:00:25.829 --> 00:00:28.444
Care may ask for an expiry.

4.1
00:00:28.444 --> 00:00:35.193
Step 4. Set the expiry. Enter it in days, hours and minutes, then select Apply tag.

4.2
00:00:35.193 --> 00:00:40.000
Care saves the tag and shows Tags updated successfully.

5.1
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:46.004
Step 5. Remove a tag. Select a tag that the patient has, under Selected Tags.

5.2
00:00:46.004 --> 00:00:50.989
Care removes it at once and shows Tags updated successfully.
